LanguageData.SSC_SharedBedTooltip:
{0}
{1}
Both the master and assigned trainer may share an ordinary multi-person bed with the sex slave. If the sex slave also has vanilla slave status, assign their master or assigned trainer to the bed first, then assign the sex slave. Normal game checks still apply.
Badges follow the direct relationships of this bed's owners; other combinations allowed by the base game remain available.
Medical rest and deathrest take priority. Ordinary rest prefers the already assigned bed.
